WEBVTT

01:41.580 --> 01:45.979
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.690 --> 01:48.920
[Episode 11]

02:02.480 --> 02:02.870
Ranran.

02:05.860 --> 02:07.090
As soon as I got here, I smelled

02:07.120 --> 02:07.840
a strong and heavy odor,

02:07.870 --> 02:09.280
like a pot about to burn through.

02:13.360 --> 02:14.680
Is there something troubling you?

02:17.079 --> 02:18.079
Can I help?

02:20.190 --> 02:21.079
If I tell you,

02:22.030 --> 02:23.120
don't be shocked.

02:30.390 --> 02:31.870
You are a spirit fruit of the Reincarnation Tree?

02:36.590 --> 02:37.120
Don't worry,

02:37.210 --> 02:37.810
I'll help you

02:37.840 --> 02:38.800
keep this secret.

02:44.240 --> 02:45.560
But when I touch you,

02:45.710 --> 02:46.590
you don't feel any different

02:46.590 --> 02:47.630
from our mortal bodies.

02:52.710 --> 02:54.470
Are you upset

02:54.680 --> 02:55.710
because Master

02:56.079 --> 02:57.520
won't tell you about your origins

02:58.310 --> 02:59.470
and you can't figure out your past?

03:03.240 --> 03:04.080
In the end,

03:04.960 --> 03:05.590
without Master,

03:05.590 --> 03:07.150
there wouldn't be the Xue Ranran of today.

03:08.190 --> 03:09.680
Master has shown me great kindness.

03:10.760 --> 03:11.340
How can I

03:11.360 --> 03:12.710
resent Master?

03:14.310 --> 03:15.000
However,

03:15.750 --> 03:17.190
I just feel a bit empty inside.

03:22.000 --> 03:23.000
Master must have his reasons

03:23.280 --> 03:24.240
for doing this.

03:24.680 --> 03:25.910
And he hasn't stopped me

03:25.910 --> 03:26.750
from seeking answers.

03:29.430 --> 03:30.360
I need to rely on myself

03:32.030 --> 03:32.870
to send Ling Xiao

03:33.230 --> 03:34.350
back safely.

03:37.370 --> 03:38.970
Someone must truly cherish you,

03:39.000 --> 03:39.750
care for you deeply,

03:40.050 --> 03:41.190
to be willing to split their soul

03:41.190 --> 03:42.960
to protect, accompany, and support you.

03:43.940 --> 03:44.730
Cultivate hard

03:44.870 --> 03:46.310
to help your Ling Xiao nourish its soul power

03:47.240 --> 03:48.800
and awaken its memories with the soul owner

03:48.820 --> 03:49.540
and connection.

03:57.840 --> 03:59.840
I will find the answer!

04:09.580 --> 04:11.550
[Eternal Sect]

04:10.320 --> 04:11.330
The disciple watching Wei Jiu

04:11.360 --> 04:12.190
saw it clearly.

04:12.710 --> 04:14.240
After Wei Jiu obtained the key,

04:14.560 --> 04:15.710
he didn't get the Spirit Spring.

04:16.190 --> 04:17.120
Frustrated and angry,

04:17.120 --> 04:18.000
he ambushed Su Yishui

04:18.390 --> 04:20.000
but was still defeated by Su Yishui.

04:21.579 --> 04:22.780
If that's the case,

04:23.360 --> 04:24.400
this Spirit Spring

04:24.680 --> 04:26.430
truly hasn't returned to the netherworld.

04:27.000 --> 04:28.270
Now even Mu Qingge

04:28.390 --> 04:29.510
doesn't know the whereabouts of the Spirit Spring.

04:30.070 --> 04:30.920
This is troublesome.

04:32.930 --> 04:34.260
This demoness is cunning and deceitful.

04:34.820 --> 04:35.730
We can't trust her easily.

04:36.830 --> 04:37.830
We still need to

04:38.460 --> 04:39.630
get a clear answer.

04:42.710 --> 04:46.370
[Exorcising Tower, Eternal Sect]

04:55.280 --> 04:56.790
You've locked me in the tower

04:57.430 --> 04:58.920
since I came to Mount Eternal.

04:59.560 --> 05:00.830
I stood on the side of the righteous

05:01.190 --> 05:02.800
Heavenly Sects on Mount Absolute.

05:03.390 --> 05:05.000
Do you still not trust me?

05:06.070 --> 05:07.630
If you revealed the whereabouts of the Spirit Spring,

05:07.650 --> 05:09.620
completely resolving the concerns of the Heavenly Sects,

05:09.800 --> 05:10.760
you wouldn't

05:11.190 --> 05:12.560
need to suffer here.

05:13.040 --> 05:14.830
When my body perished and soul scattered,

05:15.560 --> 05:16.620
the Spirit Spring departed on its own.

05:16.720 --> 05:17.830
I truly don't know.

05:18.610 --> 05:20.200
I have long been useless to the Spirit Spring

05:20.580 --> 05:21.650
and I can't even sense

05:21.680 --> 05:22.720
where it is.

05:24.710 --> 05:25.900
If you really don't know,

05:26.240 --> 05:27.480
then you'll have to stay here

05:27.510 --> 05:28.680
for some more time.

05:29.160 --> 05:30.360
When your demonic bones

05:30.360 --> 05:31.310
are thoroughly cleansed

05:31.710 --> 05:33.630
and the Spirit Spring has nothing to attach to,

05:34.490 --> 05:35.700
then we'll discuss the future.

05:36.240 --> 05:37.240
Back then,

05:37.600 --> 05:39.240
you stagnated in the early Nascent Soul stage

05:39.630 --> 05:41.830
with no further progress due to unresolvable karma from killing.

05:42.630 --> 05:43.750
Counting the days,

05:44.800 --> 05:46.000
your heavenly tribulation must be approaching, right?

05:51.950 --> 05:53.580
I am willing to resolve your worries.

06:02.070 --> 06:03.160
The Spirit Spring still shows no response.

06:03.750 --> 06:05.160
Why don't we try to find a way now

06:05.160 --> 06:06.510
to retrieve the key to the netherworld,

06:06.830 --> 06:08.070
so we don't have to run back and forth later?

06:13.310 --> 06:13.800
You...

06:14.160 --> 06:14.830
When did you...

06:15.480 --> 06:17.160
When I was using the demonic vine to absorb Wei Jiu's spiritual power,

06:18.070 --> 06:19.510
he hid the key in his void.

06:19.790 --> 06:20.790
I took it back while I was at it.

06:23.920 --> 06:24.360
Then,

06:24.680 --> 06:25.360
about the soul oath...

06:25.830 --> 06:26.760
He broke the oath first,

06:27.070 --> 06:28.040
so naturally, I'm no longer bound by it.

06:29.820 --> 06:31.180
I also took the opportunity to place

06:31.200 --> 06:32.230
a Spirit-Detecting Curse in his void.

06:32.750 --> 06:33.390
He was so preoccupied with

06:33.390 --> 06:34.390
the spiritual power I absorbed from him

06:34.510 --> 06:35.310
that he didn't notice at all.

06:35.720 --> 06:36.750
A Spirit-Detecting Curse?

06:38.000 --> 06:38.720
Then doesn't that mean you can

06:38.750 --> 06:40.190
monitor his spiritual power fluctuations at any time?

06:40.650 --> 06:41.290
The Spirit Spring originates from

06:41.320 --> 06:42.760
the founder of the Celestial Sect,

06:43.159 --> 06:43.800
the Mortal-Demon Lord.

06:44.480 --> 06:45.830
Wei Jiu is a descendant of the Celestial Sect.

06:46.480 --> 06:47.720
He's been single-mindedly seeking the Spirit Spring.

06:48.070 --> 06:48.800
If one plan fails,

06:49.310 --> 06:50.600
he might have ways as a demonic cultivator

06:50.830 --> 06:51.950
to find the whereabouts of the Spirit Spring.

06:52.390 --> 06:53.350
We can't go wrong to keep an eye on him.

06:55.750 --> 06:56.950
No wonder Wei Jiu said

06:56.970 --> 06:58.770
you're cunning and treacherous.

07:01.390 --> 07:02.750
No matter how urgent the Spirit Spring matter is, we have to wait.

07:03.680 --> 07:04.240
Right now,

07:04.510 --> 07:05.750
we still need to resolve the trouble

07:05.750 --> 07:06.360
with the Soul-Devouring Lock.

07:06.920 --> 07:08.250
But Ranran's spiritual power is insufficient

07:08.390 --> 07:09.190
and can't find a solution.

07:09.920 --> 07:10.800
Fortunately, you've absorbed

07:10.800 --> 07:11.920
Wei Jiu's Golden Core power,

07:12.070 --> 07:13.040
allowing you to manipulate the Resentment Liquid

07:13.200 --> 07:14.270
to suppress Mu Ranwu's spiritual power.

07:14.940 --> 07:16.500
She's also held up in the Eternal Sect,

07:16.920 --> 07:17.560
so  she doesn't pose

07:17.560 --> 07:18.360
a threat to Ranran for now.

07:19.310 --> 07:20.240
Variables are hard to control.

07:20.690 --> 07:21.450
We must stay vigilant.

07:23.910 --> 07:24.840
Master used demonic vines

07:24.870 --> 07:25.830
against Wei Jiu.

07:26.040 --> 07:26.680
That's something the righteous sect

07:26.680 --> 07:27.920
explicitly forbids as demonic magic.

07:28.440 --> 07:30.120
Senior, don't shout so loudly.

07:31.040 --> 07:32.240
Master using demonic magic

07:32.260 --> 07:33.909
isn't something that can be resolved by my silence.

07:34.360 --> 07:35.070
If Wei Jiu

07:35.190 --> 07:36.560
spreads the news about Master

07:36.580 --> 07:37.370
using demonic magic,

07:37.560 --> 07:37.950
then...

07:38.070 --> 07:39.920
Then what should we do?

07:40.920 --> 07:42.070
Wei Jiu would be more afraid of this matter

07:42.070 --> 07:43.040
being spread around.

07:43.950 --> 07:44.600
Senior,

07:45.360 --> 07:46.270
given the circumstances at that time,

07:46.290 --> 07:47.600
if Master hadn't used that unexpected move,

07:48.290 --> 07:48.890
all of us

07:48.920 --> 07:50.580
would have certainly died at Wei Jiu's hands.

07:51.390 --> 07:53.070
Of course I know that.

07:54.190 --> 07:54.680
But...

07:55.240 --> 07:56.650
But it's still demonic magic after all.

07:57.240 --> 07:57.920
And...

07:59.330 --> 08:00.420
And I never thought

08:00.790 --> 08:02.910
that our Master, who usually appears so immortal-like,

08:03.720 --> 08:04.800
would be like this.

08:06.170 --> 08:07.090
Whether one is righteous or demonic

08:07.120 --> 08:08.290
depends on what one does.

08:08.800 --> 08:09.720
Master used that vine

08:09.750 --> 08:11.120
to fight against demonic cultivators and protect us.

08:11.680 --> 08:12.590
How does eliminating evil

08:12.740 --> 08:13.690
and saving people not follow

08:13.720 --> 08:14.920
the Heavenly righteous sects' principles?

08:15.390 --> 08:16.520
Master is truly remarkable.

08:23.800 --> 08:24.630
Master.

08:27.060 --> 08:27.890
All things grow

08:27.920 --> 08:28.680
in their own way.

08:29.130 --> 08:30.010
Whether one is demonic or immortal

08:30.040 --> 08:30.870
is determined by the heart.

08:31.310 --> 08:32.320
How can that which can save a life

08:32.720 --> 08:34.080
be considered demonic?

08:35.510 --> 08:36.080
However,

08:36.630 --> 08:37.840
such powerful demonic magic

08:38.150 --> 08:39.080
can be cultivated by me

08:39.390 --> 08:40.150
but not you all.

08:40.960 --> 08:41.510
Understand?

08:42.669 --> 08:43.960
Understood, Master.

08:45.440 --> 08:46.480
You've been practicing basic pill formulas

08:46.510 --> 08:47.200
for some time now.

08:47.550 --> 08:49.270
Today, do you dare to challenge advanced pill formulas?

08:57.550 --> 08:58.390
Scarlet wood fruit,

08:58.510 --> 08:59.230
imperial wood,

08:59.320 --> 08:59.910
glory seeds,

08:59.930 --> 09:01.330
celestial crystal, jade essence...

09:01.840 --> 09:03.390
These are all top rare spiritual treasures.

09:03.660 --> 09:05.350
You're willing to let us practice with them?

09:06.910 --> 09:07.670
Think carefully

09:08.180 --> 09:09.540
about how to use these spiritual treasures.

09:10.670 --> 09:11.670
Relying solely on cultivation

09:11.830 --> 09:13.440
makes it difficult to quickly replenish spiritual power.

09:14.910 --> 09:15.600
What about alchemy?

09:17.670 --> 09:18.960
Mu Qingge's talent for alchemy

09:19.320 --> 09:20.360
was unmatched in the world.

09:21.150 --> 09:22.670
If Ranran can refine the Spirit-Nourishing Pill...

09:23.120 --> 09:24.240
Master and the current Ranran

09:24.240 --> 09:25.030
can't be compared.

09:26.080 --> 09:27.910
She's just started learning the art of alchemy.

09:28.320 --> 09:29.570
I think you've gone mad.

09:30.750 --> 09:31.480
I'm certain

09:32.030 --> 09:33.080
that those things fused into her spirit

09:33.080 --> 09:34.030
that belong to her

09:34.700 --> 09:35.580
cannot be taken away by anyone.

09:42.000 --> 09:43.000
Master.

09:45.150 --> 09:46.670
I have a question to ask.

09:48.030 --> 09:49.200
Today is the Mid-Autumn Festival.

09:49.360 --> 09:51.600
May we be allowed to go down the mountain

09:51.750 --> 09:52.600
to visit our families for a few days?

09:58.800 --> 09:59.760
I allow you to go down the mountain for three days

09:59.790 --> 10:00.670
to reunite with your families.

10:01.250 --> 10:02.050
Don't forget your studies.

10:03.440 --> 10:04.390
Thank you, Master.

10:21.270 --> 10:23.030
Everyone has family to reunite with.

10:23.790 --> 10:25.150
I have no home to return to.

10:27.150 --> 10:28.240
Only you are left to keep me company,

10:28.390 --> 10:28.960
Ling Xiao.

10:29.670 --> 10:30.630
Who said you don't have a home?

10:34.960 --> 10:35.720
Master.

10:40.510 --> 10:41.200
Plant this.

11:11.600 --> 11:12.910
Someone once told me

11:14.080 --> 11:15.270
that planting a tree somewhere

11:15.910 --> 11:17.320
means you have a home there.

11:19.150 --> 11:20.390
Mount Wester will be your home from now on.

11:21.390 --> 11:22.000
You are no longer

11:22.000 --> 11:23.030
homeless.

11:26.720 --> 11:27.270
I

11:28.080 --> 11:29.200
will have a home from now on.

11:34.120 --> 11:35.120
It will also protect you

11:35.790 --> 11:36.670
and bring you good fortune in all things.

11:41.240 --> 11:42.270
What's that?

11:42.550 --> 11:43.420
It smells nice

11:43.600 --> 11:44.630
with a hint of a burnt odor.

12:00.270 --> 12:00.820
Is this

12:01.030 --> 12:01.550
a mooncake?

12:03.510 --> 12:04.270
It's fitting for the Mid-Autumn Festival.

12:04.600 --> 12:05.390
I just casually baked some.

12:05.860 --> 12:06.670
If you don't want to eat them, that's fine.

12:07.790 --> 12:09.390
You made these for me yourself.

12:09.630 --> 12:10.320
I want to eat them.

12:10.630 --> 12:11.360
Thank you, Master.

12:26.550 --> 12:27.080
Master,

12:27.670 --> 12:29.320
this mooncake is exceptionally crispy.

12:29.670 --> 12:31.120
I've never had anything like it before.

12:32.510 --> 12:33.150
So?

12:34.960 --> 12:35.750
In return,

12:36.500 --> 12:37.690
I know a place that also makes

12:37.720 --> 12:38.550
really delicious mooncakes.

12:38.840 --> 12:39.830
Let me take you there to try them.

12:44.080 --> 12:44.910
Let's go, Master.

12:45.110 --> 12:46.270
If we hesitate any longer, we won't be able to get in line.

12:59.390 --> 13:00.320
Master, hurry and try them.

13:00.510 --> 13:02.000
Their mooncakes are really delicious.

13:14.790 --> 13:15.810
Having you accompany me

13:15.860 --> 13:16.930
makes me so happy.

13:17.360 --> 13:17.910
Master,

13:18.320 --> 13:19.480
can we spend every Mid-Autumn Festival together

13:19.550 --> 13:20.510
from now on?

13:23.600 --> 13:24.270
Every year?

13:28.510 --> 13:29.790
Is there anything else you want to do now?

13:31.430 --> 13:32.470
Since we've finally come down from the mountain,

13:32.640 --> 13:33.520
there is one place

13:33.690 --> 13:34.740
I'd really like to visit.

13:35.550 --> 13:36.040
Let's go.

13:40.580 --> 13:42.740
[Xue Village]

13:42.000 --> 13:42.840
Ranran,

13:43.010 --> 13:44.170
during these days you were missing,

13:44.200 --> 13:45.600
I was so worried about you.

13:46.120 --> 13:47.630
But now that I see you're safe,

13:47.750 --> 13:48.870
I'm relieved.

13:49.870 --> 13:51.600
It's so unexpected.

13:52.200 --> 13:54.080
You went up the mountain to become an immortal.

13:54.200 --> 13:55.360
I didn't expect it myself.

13:55.600 --> 13:56.200
To think that I,

13:56.200 --> 13:57.600
Xue Ranran, who's so enamored with the mortal world,

13:57.840 --> 13:59.120
would have a destined connection with immortality.

14:00.720 --> 14:02.270
Are you comfortable living on the mountain?

14:03.270 --> 14:04.670
I saw your Master.

14:05.480 --> 14:06.790
He looks quite cold.

14:07.630 --> 14:08.320
Don't worry.

14:08.600 --> 14:09.670
Master was afraid I'd be lonely

14:09.670 --> 14:10.550
by myself on the mountain,

14:10.750 --> 14:12.150
so he specially accompanied me down for the holiday.

14:12.630 --> 14:14.080
He bought all these delicious treats.

14:14.100 --> 14:14.820
Really?

14:15.390 --> 14:16.200
He also took me

14:16.200 --> 14:17.470
to plant a tree on Mount Wester.

14:18.030 --> 14:19.790
From now on, I'll have a home on Mount Wester.

14:21.320 --> 14:23.080
If that's the case, then I can rest assured.

14:23.480 --> 14:24.120
Ranran,

14:24.930 --> 14:26.870
remember to come visit me often in the future.

14:33.000 --> 14:33.790
I might not

14:33.870 --> 14:35.170
have walked this path ten thousand times before,

14:35.200 --> 14:36.390
but I've certainly walked it thousands of times.

14:37.390 --> 14:38.200
But today,

14:38.360 --> 14:39.270
it feels especially different.

14:40.240 --> 14:40.790
Today,

14:41.120 --> 14:42.200
Master is accompanying me

14:42.510 --> 14:43.480
and even lighting the way for me.

14:44.080 --> 14:44.630
It's wonderful.

14:45.310 --> 14:46.530
Are you ready to go back now?

14:48.510 --> 14:49.000
No.

14:49.610 --> 14:50.540
I just realized

14:50.720 --> 14:51.790
there's still one thing I forgot.

14:53.030 --> 14:54.720
If you forgot something, let's go buy it quickly.

14:55.550 --> 14:56.030
No,

14:56.320 --> 14:57.120
we can't buy it.

14:57.440 --> 14:58.390
We have to steal it.

14:59.360 --> 15:00.030
Steal?

15:00.630 --> 15:01.960
In my hometown, there's a custom.

15:02.200 --> 15:03.320
As long as an unmarried woman

15:03.390 --> 15:04.440
steals a good green onion

15:04.440 --> 15:05.360
from another person's garden

15:05.360 --> 15:06.240
on the Mid-Autumn Festival,

15:06.600 --> 15:08.170
she will marry a good husband in the future.

15:08.480 --> 15:09.200
So,

15:09.480 --> 15:10.670
if I don't manage to steal any green onions,

15:10.840 --> 15:12.550
this Mid-Autumn Festival won't be complete.

15:12.870 --> 15:13.510
Stealing green onions?

15:14.670 --> 15:15.480
How improper.

15:26.000 --> 15:26.440
Ranran?

15:27.600 --> 15:28.030
Ranran?

15:34.720 --> 15:35.200
Hurry up.

15:35.360 --> 15:35.870
Are you done yet?

15:36.960 --> 15:37.550
No,

15:38.600 --> 15:40.070
it seems this house doesn't have any green onions.

15:41.360 --> 15:42.320
This house doesn't have any either?

15:42.600 --> 15:43.910
Have you been searching properly?

16:00.870 --> 16:01.510
What's this?

16:02.960 --> 16:03.630
You found it!

16:03.750 --> 16:04.270
Master,

16:04.440 --> 16:05.360
my ideal husband!

16:30.150 --> 16:31.240
Who's there?

16:44.360 --> 16:44.910
Master,

16:45.030 --> 16:45.910
my ideal husband!

16:48.670 --> 16:49.360
Ling Xiao,

16:49.800 --> 16:51.450
why do you think Master went straight to his room

16:51.480 --> 16:52.720
with a cold face after we came back?

16:53.510 --> 16:54.360
Was it because I was too excited earlier

16:54.390 --> 16:55.360
and shouted carelessly,

16:55.550 --> 16:56.270
offending Master

16:56.440 --> 16:57.270
and making him angry?

17:16.440 --> 17:18.440
Everything was fine before.

17:19.109 --> 17:20.920
Master even smiled at me.

17:22.440 --> 17:24.170
Master's smile is so gentle.

17:26.200 --> 17:27.589
It's a pity I don't know how to talk properly.

17:28.160 --> 17:29.880
I can't even make Master smile more.

17:52.920 --> 17:53.880
I've come in again?

17:57.440 --> 17:59.480
Why is your consciousness getting colder?

17:59.790 --> 18:00.590
Are you alright?

18:02.110 --> 18:03.110
Today is the Mid-Autumn Festival.

18:03.510 --> 18:05.160
I wonder how you celebrated it.

18:05.480 --> 18:06.790
Did anyone accompany you?

18:08.680 --> 18:10.270
I'm so grateful to meet Master

18:10.290 --> 18:11.180
and stay at Mount Wester.

18:12.000 --> 18:12.790
When I

18:12.960 --> 18:14.350
lived alone before,

18:14.680 --> 18:16.070
I felt indifferent about everything.

18:16.960 --> 18:17.720
but it turns out having someone

18:17.750 --> 18:19.070
to eat, drink, and have fun with

18:19.440 --> 18:20.720
is indeed different.

18:23.270 --> 18:24.960
He even stole a green onion with me.

18:26.030 --> 18:26.750
I found it.

18:26.960 --> 18:27.480
Master,

18:27.590 --> 18:28.440
my ideal husband!

18:33.650 --> 18:34.270
And also,

18:34.400 --> 18:35.250
did you know—

18:36.830 --> 18:37.350
Cut off thoughts.

18:51.600 --> 18:52.450
Why is the Guardian meditating

18:52.480 --> 18:53.550
on the Ice Lotus Pool so early?

18:54.000 --> 18:54.920
He sat

18:54.920 --> 18:55.830
in this pool all night.

18:59.550 --> 19:00.830
Something's not right.

19:06.500 --> 19:09.890
[Jade Pool, Eternal Sect]

19:07.270 --> 19:08.100
Mu Qingge,

19:09.480 --> 19:10.400
are you willingly

19:10.400 --> 19:12.310
giving your Golden Core to me?

19:13.270 --> 19:13.920
Yes,

19:15.030 --> 19:16.160
I am willing to help you

19:16.190 --> 19:17.270
successfully overcome the heavenly tribulation.

19:18.010 --> 19:18.790
I only hope that you

19:18.830 --> 19:20.110
can see my determination to repent.

19:27.310 --> 19:29.310
If you are truly sincere in your repentance,

19:29.960 --> 19:30.830
after this,

19:31.030 --> 19:33.280
I will certainly inform all Heavenly Sects

19:33.680 --> 19:35.510
to search for the Spirit Spring's whereabouts.

19:35.890 --> 19:37.370
You will no longer be seen as a threat

19:37.790 --> 19:39.200
or be confined here.

19:40.590 --> 19:42.110
Thank you, Immortal, for giving me this chance.

20:06.240 --> 20:06.790
Indeed.

20:07.310 --> 20:07.960
Master taught me

20:07.960 --> 20:09.550
the formula for the Spirit-Nourishing Pill to reconnect Spirit Roots.

20:10.160 --> 20:11.550
There's no precedent for the Formless Spirit Root,

20:11.830 --> 20:12.790
but by drawing analogies,

20:13.350 --> 20:13.830
it's nothing more than

20:13.830 --> 20:15.480
gathering materials that harmonize the Five Elements

20:15.880 --> 20:16.960
to refine the Five Elements Spirit-Nourishing Pill.

20:17.440 --> 20:19.200
This pill might be able to reconnect

20:19.200 --> 20:20.100
my Formless Spirit Root.

20:30.510 --> 20:31.160
Mu Qingge,

20:32.640 --> 20:34.360
how could you advance at this moment?

20:35.370 --> 20:36.130
How is this possible?

20:44.710 --> 20:45.790
I'm sorry, Immortal.

20:46.410 --> 20:48.370
My advancement lightning tribulation is coming too!

21:08.850 --> 21:09.610
Why is there suddenly

21:09.630 --> 21:10.760
an overflow of spiritual power?

21:30.550 --> 21:31.790
Just a little more.

21:54.880 --> 21:55.430
Ranran,

21:55.450 --> 21:56.310
stop cultivating and protect your heart!

22:24.510 --> 22:26.030
Your Golden Core has shattered.

22:27.710 --> 22:29.100
I forgot to tell you

22:30.440 --> 22:32.640
that although I was born with Five Spirit Roots,

22:32.920 --> 22:35.330
each root was incomplete.

22:35.530 --> 22:36.370
The Eternal Sect's Jade Pool

22:36.400 --> 22:38.290
helped me rush straight to the Nascent Soul realm.

22:39.030 --> 22:40.710
It's just a pity for you.

22:41.440 --> 22:42.640
On top of the heavenly tribulation,

22:42.920 --> 22:43.630
you also suffered

22:43.660 --> 22:45.340
the attack of my advancement lightning tribulation.

22:45.550 --> 22:45.880
You...

22:46.640 --> 22:47.160
Master!

22:47.920 --> 22:48.480
Master!

22:49.400 --> 22:49.880
You demoness,

22:50.380 --> 22:51.030
what have you done?

22:52.570 --> 22:53.610
It was Immortal Kaiyuan

22:53.640 --> 22:55.310
who wanted to take my Golden Core to pass the heavenly tribulation.

22:55.750 --> 22:57.510
Who knew it would backfire and hurt himself?

22:58.550 --> 22:59.440
It has nothing to do with me.

23:00.100 --> 23:01.190
Stop talking nonsense!

23:01.790 --> 23:03.070
How dare you claim my Master to be

23:03.070 --> 23:04.310
someone who would casually steal others' Golden Cores?

23:05.380 --> 23:06.140
How dare you ruin

23:06.170 --> 23:07.540
the reputation of the Eternal Sect's sovereign?

23:09.000 --> 23:10.160
But your sovereign

23:10.710 --> 23:11.790
is exactly that kind of person.

23:12.270 --> 23:13.060
Mu Qingge,

23:13.270 --> 23:14.790
I see you have no intention of repenting.

23:15.390 --> 23:16.040
Seize her!

23:16.270 --> 23:17.200
Who dares to touch her?

23:18.240 --> 23:19.440
Who dares to intrude on our Mount Eternal?

23:20.400 --> 23:21.790
The Eastern Palace's Exotic Pavilion

23:22.460 --> 23:23.570
accompanies the Crown Prince

23:23.910 --> 23:25.110
to pay respects to Immortal Kaiyuan.

23:26.500 --> 23:27.780
Welcome, Crown Prince.

23:40.350 --> 23:41.070
Yu.

23:44.110 --> 23:45.590
I knew you would come.

23:46.710 --> 23:48.510
I endured this suffering under her identity

23:49.480 --> 23:50.830
just to wait for you.

23:57.640 --> 23:58.350
Yu.

24:00.640 --> 24:01.880
Is the bottle of Mistaken Divine

24:02.130 --> 24:03.260
that I buried in your courtyard

24:03.920 --> 24:04.720
still there?

24:06.200 --> 24:06.680
It is.

24:10.200 --> 24:12.150
I really want to take a sip now.

24:22.310 --> 24:23.720
I've been waiting for you to come back

24:25.550 --> 24:26.510
to drink with me again.

24:32.030 --> 24:32.590
Your Highness.

24:33.160 --> 24:33.790
This demoness

24:34.270 --> 24:35.160
hurt my Master.

24:35.640 --> 24:36.790
Immortal Master, mind your words.

24:37.590 --> 24:39.000
Madam Battle was personally appointed by His Majesty.

24:39.000 --> 24:39.870
How dare you defame her?

24:42.240 --> 24:43.830
Her old grudges with the Heavenly Sect

24:43.830 --> 24:44.680
were already settled

24:44.700 --> 24:45.460
18 years ago.

24:47.270 --> 24:47.790
I will

24:48.640 --> 24:49.590
bring her back.

24:50.750 --> 24:51.640
If anyone wants to claim her,

24:51.640 --> 24:52.880
come to the Eastern Palace.

24:58.900 --> 24:59.350
Your Highness—

25:07.970 --> 25:08.770
You're full of cold energy.

25:08.800 --> 25:09.600
Don't freeze Master.

25:11.920 --> 25:12.880
Is she really alright?

25:14.120 --> 25:15.080
Surprisingly, the Soul-Devouring Lock didn't

25:15.100 --> 25:16.300
drain all her spiritual power.

25:17.070 --> 25:18.550
It's the Spirit-Nourishing Pill that Ranran refined.

25:19.360 --> 25:20.450
What the Soul-Devouring Lock absorbed was

25:20.480 --> 25:21.440
the power of the Spirit-Nourishing Pill.

25:22.410 --> 25:24.410
In terms of alchemy talent,

25:24.440 --> 25:25.590
Master is still the best.

25:26.680 --> 25:27.510
No one can match her.

25:28.160 --> 25:29.400
As long as the Soul-Devouring Lock isn't removed,

25:29.880 --> 25:30.880
the danger will remain.

25:31.350 --> 25:32.350
We need to quickly restore the Spirit Root

25:32.350 --> 25:33.400
and form the Golden Core.

25:34.160 --> 25:34.880
Mu Ranwu

25:35.400 --> 25:37.010
will have to pay back this debt sooner or later.

25:39.170 --> 25:41.340
[Eastern Palace, Imperial Capital]

25:44.450 --> 25:48.870
[Madam Battle Hall, Eastern Palace]

25:53.920 --> 25:55.510
This hall was built especially for you.

25:56.310 --> 25:57.030
The palace buildings

25:57.030 --> 25:58.200
all have restrictions on magic,

25:58.960 --> 25:59.720
but this place

25:59.960 --> 26:01.100
can bypass those restrictions,

26:01.400 --> 26:02.400
allowing you to practice without hindrance.

26:04.720 --> 26:05.440
Do you like it?

26:09.310 --> 26:10.830
You still prefer

26:11.440 --> 26:12.480
my original appearance.

26:15.030 --> 26:16.640
But all the past experiences

26:16.920 --> 26:17.640
are like a dream now.

26:19.160 --> 26:20.640
Only upon waking did I realize

26:21.820 --> 26:23.420
I shouldn't live like I used to.

26:25.270 --> 26:26.680
I want to live this life

26:27.480 --> 26:28.270
with a brand new appearance.

26:31.110 --> 26:31.750
Qingge,

26:32.750 --> 26:34.060
no matter what you look like,

26:34.920 --> 26:35.750
as long as it's you,

26:36.690 --> 26:37.280
it's good.

26:38.330 --> 26:38.890
Come here!

26:40.100 --> 26:40.580
Here.

26:41.270 --> 26:42.000
Take down the paintings.

26:42.310 --> 26:42.990
Put them all away.

26:43.480 --> 26:44.000
Yes.

26:55.590 --> 26:56.680
You have grown up.

26:57.590 --> 26:58.400
But you look

26:58.960 --> 27:00.270
the same as when we parted.

27:01.200 --> 27:02.270
Have you practiced

27:02.440 --> 27:03.620
the art of preserving youth and beauty?

27:05.270 --> 27:06.480
I was afraid that if I aged

27:07.240 --> 27:08.030
and became ugly,

27:08.840 --> 27:09.520
you, Master Mu,

27:09.550 --> 27:10.480
wouldn't want to see me anymore.

27:11.510 --> 27:12.070
Very good.

27:12.680 --> 27:13.510
It pleases me greatly.

27:14.160 --> 27:15.270
Then, are you willing to stay?

27:16.550 --> 27:17.280
In this lifetime,

27:18.280 --> 27:18.930
I won't let you

27:18.960 --> 27:20.070
suffer any grievances

27:20.790 --> 27:21.720
or be hurt anymore.

27:27.070 --> 27:28.160
You don't have to agree right away.

27:29.400 --> 27:30.590
You must be tired today.

27:31.710 --> 27:32.760
After you've rested,

27:34.470 --> 27:35.670
I also have a lot more...

27:37.700 --> 27:38.570
to say to you.

27:43.340 --> 27:44.300
All of you, leave now.

27:46.110 --> 27:46.960
Yes,

27:55.920 --> 27:56.880
Madam Battle.

28:00.660 --> 28:01.510
What a pity.

28:03.100 --> 28:04.510
Now, your spiritual power,

28:05.590 --> 28:06.480
your life,

28:08.350 --> 28:08.920
and that Su Yu,

28:08.950 --> 28:10.710
who is obsessed with you,

28:12.500 --> 28:13.950
all belong to me now.

28:15.440 --> 28:16.070
What remains

28:17.640 --> 28:18.480
of you is nothing but

28:18.500 --> 28:19.870
a mere title.

28:21.050 --> 28:22.320
But I refuse to use your face

28:22.350 --> 28:23.400
to continue this life.

28:25.590 --> 28:26.440
Gradually,

28:27.790 --> 28:29.750
Su Yu will forget the old you.

28:32.200 --> 28:33.310
The one by his side

28:34.110 --> 28:34.830
will be me

28:36.240 --> 28:37.270
and only me.

28:58.590 --> 28:59.240
You

29:00.380 --> 29:01.640
hate Qingge.

29:04.920 --> 29:06.750
I just want her to disappear.

29:07.110 --> 29:08.240
With her around,

29:08.830 --> 29:10.440
I will never be seen.

29:14.030 --> 29:15.110
This Soul-Devouring Lock

29:16.160 --> 29:17.790
will easily give you

29:17.810 --> 29:19.410
everything she possessed.

29:29.400 --> 29:30.310
During the ascension,

29:30.750 --> 29:31.510
the Soul-Devouring Lock

29:31.510 --> 29:32.830
didn't sense her spiritual power.

29:33.920 --> 29:34.830
Does the fruit

29:34.830 --> 29:36.200
that I squeezed out 18 years ago

29:37.110 --> 29:38.240
still exist?

29:39.350 --> 29:40.200
Would Su Yishui

29:40.220 --> 29:42.020
really disregard Qingge?

30:24.550 --> 30:26.000
Doesn't the Collection of Entertainment say

30:26.400 --> 30:27.790
that Master doesn't like to play the qin?

30:28.920 --> 30:30.830
When Grandmaster asked him to play a tune,

30:31.560 --> 30:32.320
he got so annoyed

30:32.350 --> 30:33.750
that he had a big fight with Grandmaster.

30:42.720 --> 30:43.310
You're awake?

30:48.410 --> 30:49.080
Thank you, Master,

30:49.110 --> 30:50.790
for saving me when I had a qi deviation while refining pills.

30:51.400 --> 30:52.240
I thought that day

30:52.240 --> 30:53.520
I recklessly offended you,

30:53.550 --> 30:54.550
angering you,

30:54.640 --> 30:55.790
and you didn't want to talk to me anymore.

30:57.720 --> 30:58.960
I just had to bring that up.

31:00.590 --> 31:01.640
The "Drunk Breeze" you played

31:01.660 --> 31:02.490
was truly beautiful.

31:12.000 --> 31:13.240
How did you know it was Drunk Breeze?

31:15.100 --> 31:16.300
Besides me,

31:16.640 --> 31:17.790
only one other person knows this tune.

31:18.990 --> 31:20.750
Is that other person Grandmaster?

31:21.790 --> 31:23.110
This was originally composed by Grandmaster.

31:23.510 --> 31:25.110
I saw the score in the Collection of Entertainment.

31:25.880 --> 31:26.810
Who knew

31:27.070 --> 31:28.270
that this was a little secret

31:28.270 --> 31:29.480
known only to you two?

31:33.680 --> 31:34.350
Master,

31:34.840 --> 31:36.320
I found the Collection of Entertainment

31:36.340 --> 31:37.560
accidentally while looking for pill formulas.

31:37.750 --> 31:38.480
I was attracted by

31:38.510 --> 31:39.920
the notes on cooking and brewing wine in it,

31:39.940 --> 31:40.770
so I kept it.

31:41.170 --> 31:42.370
I won't dare

31:42.400 --> 31:43.920
to keep Grandmaster's things secretly anymore.

31:49.560 --> 31:51.510
Although Grandmaster wrote the Beast chapter,

31:51.960 --> 31:53.590
I don't think there was any malice in it.

31:54.480 --> 31:55.920
It was just recording trivial matters,

31:56.320 --> 31:57.600
wanting to understand you better, Master.

31:58.790 --> 31:59.450
You've read it all?

32:00.010 --> 32:01.250
I also want to know about you.

32:01.830 --> 32:02.510
What did the Beast chapter

32:02.510 --> 32:03.400
talk about?

32:04.000 --> 32:04.550
Recite it.

32:07.270 --> 32:09.480
Actually, I didn't read it that carefully.

32:09.830 --> 32:10.240
Recite it.

32:12.400 --> 32:13.530
This beast is fierce

32:13.790 --> 32:14.960
and doesn't like green onions and garlic.

32:15.260 --> 32:16.330
It's vengeful.

32:16.650 --> 32:17.940
You must be careful when teasing it.

32:18.680 --> 32:20.070
If you praise its appearance,

32:20.720 --> 32:21.880
it will be the most murderous.

32:22.440 --> 32:23.720
It must be teased gradually.

32:24.010 --> 32:25.280
However, if appeased with

32:25.310 --> 32:26.400
dried longan preserved in sea salt,

32:26.880 --> 32:28.000
its anger can be reduced by 30%.

32:28.830 --> 32:29.720
Master, do you really like

32:29.720 --> 32:30.550
eating dried longan that much?

32:30.640 --> 32:31.750
I can try to make some.

32:32.350 --> 32:33.510
Stop reading these useless things.

32:34.200 --> 32:34.790
There are some

32:34.790 --> 32:35.880
excerpts on pill-making techniques here.

32:36.400 --> 32:37.200
You might as well read more of those.

32:38.050 --> 32:38.610
I haven't punished you yet

32:38.640 --> 32:39.750
for ignoring the signs of spiritual power overflow,

32:40.160 --> 32:41.440
disobeying my orders, and recklessly showing off.

32:41.920 --> 32:43.030
You have no discipline at all.

32:43.720 --> 32:44.240
Early tomorrow morning,

32:44.270 --> 32:45.550
go to the spirit stream behind the mountain to fetch water

32:46.000 --> 32:47.270
and water all the flowers and plants

32:47.310 --> 32:48.070
behind the mountain.

32:48.590 --> 32:49.550
Don't miss a single one.

32:51.550 --> 32:52.510
This will help temper

32:52.510 --> 32:53.400
your reckless nature.

32:54.110 --> 32:54.720
Yes,

32:55.140 --> 32:55.790
Master.

33:02.510 --> 33:03.030
Qingge!

33:06.070 --> 33:06.790
What's the matter?

33:08.200 --> 33:08.720
Your Highness,

33:09.750 --> 33:10.750
Madam Battle was posoined with

33:11.110 --> 33:11.720
the Resentment Liquid

33:11.920 --> 33:13.550
from the Scarlet Sect.

33:14.200 --> 33:14.920
Wei Jiu?

33:16.160 --> 33:17.030
Didn't he and Su Yishui

33:17.030 --> 33:17.920
make a soul oath

33:18.830 --> 33:20.200
not to harm Qingge in any way?

33:21.110 --> 33:22.400
Wei Jiu poisoned me by using

33:23.030 --> 33:24.680
the Resentment Liquid to water the Reincarnation Tree.

33:26.000 --> 33:27.440
This was before the soul oath was made.

33:28.880 --> 33:30.480
Even if I die because of this,

33:31.040 --> 33:32.280
it wouldn't be considered a breach of the oath.

33:32.950 --> 33:33.860
This is outrageous!

33:34.880 --> 33:35.640
Your Highness, please calm down.

33:36.140 --> 33:37.510
I've already sent people to the Scarlet Sect

33:37.790 --> 33:38.830
to test the waters first.

33:41.640 --> 33:42.530
The news has arrived.

33:43.550 --> 33:44.370
Mu Qingge,

33:45.000 --> 33:46.030
since our parting at Mount Absolute,

33:46.500 --> 33:47.370
I imagine you've been

33:47.400 --> 33:48.510
thinking of me constantly.

33:48.920 --> 33:49.880
Come to the Scarlet Sect,

33:50.240 --> 33:51.680
offer all your spiritual power,

33:52.140 --> 33:54.010
and spend a lovely night with me.

33:54.580 --> 33:56.900
I will naturally help you neutralize the Resentment Liquid.

33:57.200 --> 33:58.480
Don't take too long.

33:59.110 --> 34:00.960
Once this Resentment Liquid reaches your heart,

34:01.640 --> 34:03.070
even the greatest immortals

34:03.170 --> 34:04.720
won't be able to save you.

34:05.680 --> 34:06.640
That bastard!

34:12.030 --> 34:12.960
Qingge, don't worry.

34:13.670 --> 34:15.030
I'll draft a Crown Prince's edict right away

34:15.710 --> 34:16.880
to widely recruit Heavenly experts.

34:18.440 --> 34:19.800
I don't believe Wei Jiu

34:19.800 --> 34:20.710
is the only one who can neutralize this Resentment Liquid.

34:25.320 --> 34:26.800
You're pushing the Resentment Liquid so urgently.

34:27.050 --> 34:28.170
Mu Ranwu can't hold on much longer.

34:31.150 --> 34:31.760
Right now,

34:32.070 --> 34:33.550
Wei Jiu can't neutralize her Resentment Liquid.

34:34.030 --> 34:35.280
You're the only one she can turn to now.

34:36.130 --> 34:37.540
You punished Ranran to the back mountain.

34:38.150 --> 34:38.850
Are you afraid

34:38.880 --> 34:40.360
that Mu Ranwu might come looking and run into her?

34:42.110 --> 34:42.840
Mu Ranwu will certainly

34:42.840 --> 34:44.070
secretly investigate her sister's whereabouts.

34:44.900 --> 34:46.130
Ranran has the Black Dragon blood protecting her,

34:46.280 --> 34:47.000
so she won't be able to find out much,

34:47.710 --> 34:49.400
but it's better to be safe than sorry.

34:50.590 --> 34:51.110
That's right.

34:51.760 --> 34:52.449
Let's carefully

34:52.480 --> 34:53.590
set up the formation for Mu Ranwu

34:53.880 --> 34:54.760
and wait for her to come.

34:57.750 --> 35:00.340
[Mount Wester]

35:04.480 --> 35:05.230
The Guardian said

35:06.130 --> 35:07.730
it's fine for you to retrieve your former

35:07.760 --> 35:09.230
magical artifacts and mount,

35:09.590 --> 35:10.440
but taking inventory of the old items

35:10.460 --> 35:11.340
will take some time.

35:11.960 --> 35:13.590
Master Mu, please come and rest for a while.

35:27.030 --> 35:28.230
Why is Mu Qingge here?

35:28.960 --> 35:29.550
Could it be

35:29.920 --> 35:30.710
she's here to reclaim

35:30.730 --> 35:31.810
the position of Mount Wester's sovereign?

35:32.600 --> 35:33.600
She once wanted to drag

35:33.630 --> 35:34.670
the entire Mount Wester down with her.

35:35.030 --> 35:36.360
If it weren't for Master's efforts to turn the tide,

35:36.830 --> 35:38.180
what face does she have to come and fight for Mount Wester?

35:39.510 --> 35:40.920
I don't think she even cares about it.

35:41.550 --> 35:42.480
She assisted

35:42.560 --> 35:43.680
the current emperor in ascending to the throne,

35:43.710 --> 35:45.550
making great contributions.

35:45.800 --> 35:48.110
It's a major cultivation taboo,

35:48.490 --> 35:49.410
but now,

35:49.440 --> 35:50.920
she's one of the most important

35:50.940 --> 35:52.050
nobles in the imperial palace.

35:54.000 --> 35:55.670
With such a powerful backer...

35:57.480 --> 35:58.800
Master Mu, please wait here for a moment.

35:59.000 --> 35:59.760
Excuse me.

36:03.670 --> 36:04.320
Let's practice.

36:10.320 --> 36:11.920
On Mount Absolute, he left without regard for me,

36:12.150 --> 36:13.440
and now he asked me to come up the mountain,

36:13.550 --> 36:14.440
only to keep me waiting.

36:14.920 --> 36:16.880
Su Yishui is deliberately humiliating me.

36:17.190 --> 36:18.630
Perhaps my suspicions are correct.

36:19.070 --> 36:19.630
He knows about

36:19.630 --> 36:21.000
the existence of the other fruit

36:21.220 --> 36:22.790
and used the Smokescreen to disguise

36:22.810 --> 36:23.680
and hide it nearby.

36:29.240 --> 36:29.930
Is this all

36:29.960 --> 36:31.360
your master usually teaches you?

36:34.070 --> 36:35.400
Why don't I play with you for a while?

36:37.880 --> 36:39.550
Mortal flesh repels me.

36:40.670 --> 36:42.280
Only the fruit grown from the same tree as me

36:42.670 --> 36:44.230
can have its spiritual power merge with mine.

36:44.960 --> 36:45.630
None of them are it.

36:49.280 --> 36:51.930
Master didn't confiscate the Collection of Entertainment

36:52.440 --> 36:54.700
and when he saw Grandmaster's Beast Chapter,

36:54.960 --> 36:56.550
he didn't seem upset.

36:57.290 --> 36:58.370
Master can even play

36:58.400 --> 37:00.440
the Drunk Breeze composed by Grandmaster.

37:02.000 --> 37:03.250
What kind of relationship

37:03.550 --> 37:05.280
did Master and Grandmaster really have?

37:09.550 --> 37:10.320
Caught something?

37:21.890 --> 37:22.810
I'm sorry,

37:22.840 --> 37:23.440
Master Mu.

37:23.710 --> 37:25.010
I didn't realize someone was here.

37:25.320 --> 37:26.750
You've actually returned to Mount Wester.

37:27.070 --> 37:28.030
What is this thing?

37:28.230 --> 37:29.640
It's a trap for catching pheasants.

37:29.670 --> 37:31.070
I learned how to set it from the Collection of Entertainment.

37:31.330 --> 37:32.200
I wanted to try making

37:32.230 --> 37:33.230
sour roasted pheasant,

37:33.440 --> 37:35.120
but I don't have any green plums at the moment.

37:35.150 --> 37:36.360
Can I use bayberries instead?

37:36.710 --> 37:38.230
What are you talking about?

37:38.720 --> 37:39.970
In this lifetime and the last,

37:40.000 --> 37:40.630
what I hate the most

37:40.630 --> 37:41.800
are these sour things.

37:42.110 --> 37:43.190
Grandmaster doesn't even remember

37:43.190 --> 37:44.510
the Collection of Entertainment she wrote herself

37:44.960 --> 37:47.360
and her personality is completely different too.

37:47.570 --> 37:48.980
Are you also Su Yishui's disciple?

37:50.110 --> 37:51.800
Does Su Yishui let you run wild like this?

37:52.590 --> 37:54.370
Then I'll discipline you on his behalf.

37:58.630 --> 37:59.550
Not her either.

38:01.800 --> 38:02.440
Master Mu,

38:02.440 --> 38:03.590
are you trying to teach my disciple for me?

38:05.150 --> 38:05.760
Shui,

38:06.480 --> 38:07.800
you've finally decided to come and meet me.

38:09.590 --> 38:10.880
Why are you still standing here?

38:11.320 --> 38:12.030
Have you finished your punishment?

38:12.800 --> 38:14.220
I will do the punishment right away.

38:18.400 --> 38:18.880
Shui,

38:19.710 --> 38:21.000
I haven't been back to Mount Wester for such a long time.

38:21.400 --> 38:22.230
Would you accompany me for a walk?

38:23.710 --> 38:24.630
You came to Mount Wester

38:25.360 --> 38:26.320
just for a walk?

38:26.760 --> 38:28.070
Indeed, I need your help with something.

38:28.480 --> 38:30.070
You have the Crown Prince's support.

38:30.440 --> 38:31.670
You have plenty of people at your disposal.

38:32.150 --> 38:33.070
Why seek help from

38:33.070 --> 38:33.960
a rustic like me?

38:35.960 --> 38:36.840
You're upset?

38:37.670 --> 38:39.150
I'm staying by Yu's side

38:39.550 --> 38:40.680
for my own reasons.

38:40.960 --> 38:41.880
But in my heart,

38:42.510 --> 38:43.630
how can he compare to you?

38:44.800 --> 38:45.670
There's no one else here.

38:46.070 --> 38:47.320
You don't need to pretend to be indifferent.

38:47.760 --> 38:48.440
I know

38:48.790 --> 38:50.030
you have feelings for me.

38:50.760 --> 38:51.630
Feelings?

38:52.550 --> 38:54.110
I never thought Master really had

38:54.480 --> 38:55.760
such feelings for Grandmaster.

38:56.840 --> 38:58.360
When my soul was scattered,

38:58.930 --> 39:00.410
only you were willing to sacrifice everything

39:00.440 --> 39:01.230
to bring me back to life.

39:01.840 --> 39:03.440
Even if I don't become an immortal in this life,

39:04.230 --> 39:05.440
I will never betray your intentions.

39:10.480 --> 39:12.000
You've been poisoned by the Scarlet Sect's Resentment Liquid.

39:12.180 --> 39:13.140
Is this why you came?

39:13.780 --> 39:14.250
I know

39:14.280 --> 39:15.590
you've studied demonic cultivation

39:16.230 --> 39:17.150
and are skilled at detoxification.

39:17.630 --> 39:18.630
I can help you detoxify.

39:20.590 --> 39:21.150
Ranran.

39:24.110 --> 39:24.960
Since you're slacking off,

39:25.350 --> 39:26.350
come to the study

39:26.630 --> 39:28.130
to brew tea, burn incense, and entertain our guest.

39:28.840 --> 39:29.380
Yes,

39:29.400 --> 39:30.000
Master.

39:35.030 --> 39:35.550
Shui,

39:36.480 --> 39:37.670
I knew you would help me.

39:38.710 --> 39:39.400
No need for words.

39:40.070 --> 39:41.630
I'll try to use my technique to expel the Resentment Liquid.

39:53.000 --> 39:55.150
Although Master's words are harsh,

39:55.590 --> 39:57.280
he's still eager to help Grandmaster detoxify.

39:58.230 --> 40:00.000
It's clear he cares deeply.

40:22.960 --> 40:23.510
Come out.

40:27.480 --> 40:27.920
Let's begin.

40:33.110 --> 40:33.840
Simultaneously stimulate

40:33.840 --> 40:35.230
Ranran and Mu Ranwu's hearts.

40:35.920 --> 40:36.960
Make the Spirit Roots appear,

40:37.740 --> 40:39.450
so I can use this Five Elements Absorption Disc

40:39.480 --> 40:40.800
to extract Mu Ranwu's Spirit Root

40:41.030 --> 40:41.710
and transfer it to Ranran.

41:01.520 --> 41:02.200
Keep a constant eye on

41:02.230 --> 41:03.190
the condition of the Soul-Devouring Lock.

41:04.110 --> 41:04.710
Mu Ranwu

41:04.710 --> 41:05.630
is unconscious now,

41:06.760 --> 41:08.070
but her heart will still protect itself,

41:08.480 --> 41:09.510
activating the Soul-Devouring Lock.

41:10.960 --> 41:12.230
If we don't stop in time,

41:12.880 --> 41:13.920
both sides will be harmed.

41:23.110 --> 41:23.670
Stop.

41:32.360 --> 41:33.550
You used Ranran's pill formula

41:33.660 --> 41:34.580
to refine the Spirit-Nourishing Pill?

41:36.070 --> 41:36.840
That's good.

41:37.880 --> 41:39.200
With the spiritual power from the Spirit-Nourishing Pill

41:39.230 --> 41:40.280
filling her heart,

41:40.940 --> 41:42.250
Mu Ranwu shouldn't notice

41:42.280 --> 41:43.630
the missing Spirit Root for a while.

41:44.000 --> 41:45.570
But if she wants to advance further in the future,

41:45.670 --> 41:46.400
it'll be troublesome.

41:47.280 --> 41:48.070
It's a pity

41:48.510 --> 41:49.880
we could only retrieve this much for Master.

41:50.400 --> 41:51.440
At least we've restored

41:51.440 --> 41:52.300
the missing Spirit Root.

41:52.930 --> 41:53.970
Her cultivation should progress faster now.

41:59.800 --> 42:00.480
They're about to wake up.

42:01.360 --> 42:02.070
You should leave first.

42:10.110 --> 42:10.630
Stiffly Su,

42:11.070 --> 42:12.670
be careful not to lose control of your Ice Lotus Technique.

42:13.230 --> 42:13.920
Cut the crap.

42:14.520 --> 42:15.000
I know.

42:49.150 --> 42:49.840
How did I...

42:50.550 --> 42:51.360
The Resentment Liquid has been neutralized.

42:51.760 --> 42:52.400
You can leave now.

43:04.630 --> 43:05.150
Shui,

43:06.760 --> 43:07.880
how did things

43:08.440 --> 43:09.110
come to this between us?

43:16.400 --> 43:17.230
What are you here for?
